{"date": "2026-10-16", "word": "Light", "summary": "A light day (forecast moderate). The upslope ran from about 08:00 to about 16:30. Cloudbase held 3,700\u20135,200 ft; the forecast had 4,300\u20135,800. Most of the day the shear line was crossing Kula Highway between Pukalani and Omaopio; about 17:07 it was crossing Kula Highway between Omaopio and the middle Lower Kula Road junction.", "therm": "<strong>Light</strong> for the day, 10:00\u201314:00<div class=\"sub\">Kula Ag's measured air through the NAM sounding (thermal.py); forecast was Moderate</div>", "base": "<span class=\"num\">3,700\u20135,200 ft</span><div class=\"sub\">Derived from the stations during the upslope; the chart above sets it against the forecast</div>", "chart": "<div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;margin:10px 0 2px\">Cloudbase, derived vs forecast</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#6b6b66);margin:2px 0 4px\">\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;border-top:2px dashed #eb6834;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Forecast, \u00b1 700 ft</span>\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;background:#2a78d6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Derived (stations)</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;min-width:0;height:220px\"><canvas id=\"basechart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Derived cloudbase against the forecast through the day\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"sub\">Derived from the stations every 15 minutes during the upslope; forecast by hour, the 08:37 morning forecast.</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var d = {\"derived\": [[540, 3850.0], [555, 3990.0], [570, 3990.0], [585, 4030.0], [600, 4250.0], [615, 4370.0], [630, 4470.0], [645, 4590.0], [660, 4640.0], [675, 4770.0], [690, 4920.0], [705, 5030.0], [720, 5180.0], [735, 5170.0], [750, 5250.0], [765, 5250.0], [780, 5040.0], [795, 5010.0], [810, 5200.0], [825, 5160.0], [840, 5050.0], [855, 5110.0], [870, 5170.0], [885, 4950.0], [900, 5050.0], [915, 5110.0], [930, 4870.0], [945, 4610.0], [960, 4380.0]], \"forecast\": [[540, 4960.0], [600, 5760.0], [660, 5760.0], [720, 4960.0], [780, 4660.0], [840, 4360.0], [900, 4260.0]], \"up\": [540, 960], \"nocu\": null}, pt = function (a) { return {x: a[0], y: a[1]}; };\n  var dark = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches, muted = '#898781', grid = dark ? '#2c2c2a' : '#e1e0d9';\n  var nocu = { id: 'nocu', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.nocu) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx,\n    x0 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[0]), x1 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[1]);\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.10)'; g.fillRect(x0, a.top, x1 - x0, a.bottom - a.top);\n    g.fillStyle = muted; g.font = '11px sans-serif'; g.textAlign = 'center';\n    g.fillText('No cumulus', (x0 + x1) / 2, a.top + (a.bottom - a.top) / 2); g.restore(); } };\n  var band = { id: 'band', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.up) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx;\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.14)';\n    g.fillRect(x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.top, x.getPixelForValue(d.up[1]) - x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.bottom - a.top); g.restore(); } };\n  var hm = function (m) { return String(Math.floor(m / 60)).padStart(2, '0') + ':' + String(m % 60).padStart(2, '0'); };\n  var BAND = 700;\n  var ys = d.derived.map(function (a) { return a[1]; }).concat(d.forecast.map(function (a) { return a[1]; }));\n  var xs = [540, 960];\n  new Chart(document.getElementById('basechart'), {\n    type: 'line',\n    data: { datasets: [\n      { label: 'Derived', data: d.derived.map(pt), borderColor: '#2a78d6', borderWidth: 2, pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'band+', data: d.forecast.map(function (a) { return {x: a[0], y: a[1] + BAND}; }), borderWidth: 0, pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3, fill: '+1', backgroundColor: 'rgba(235,104,52,0.13)' },\n      { label: 'band-', data: d.forecast.map(function (a) { return {x: a[0], y: a[1] - BAND}; }), borderWidth: 0, pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3, fill: false },\n      { label: 'Forecast', data: d.forecast.map(pt), borderColor: '#eb6834', borderWidth: 2, borderDash: [6, 4], pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#eb6834', tension: 0.3 }\n    ] },\n    options: { responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false, interaction: { mode: 'nearest', axis: 'x', intersect: false },\n      plugins: { legend: { display: false }, tooltip: { callbacks: {\n        title: function (i) { return hm(i[0].parsed.x); },\n        label: function (i) { return i.dataset.label + ': ' + Math.round(i.parsed.y).toLocaleString() + ' ft'; } },\n        filter: function (i) { return i.dataset.label.indexOf('band') < 0; } } },\n      scales: {\n        x: { type: 'linear', min: xs[0], max: xs[1], ticks: { stepSize: 60, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return hm(v); } }, grid: { display: false } },\n        y: { min: Math.min(3500, Math.floor(Math.min.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500),\n              max: Math.max(7000, Math.ceil(Math.max.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500),\n              ticks: { stepSize: 500, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return v.toLocaleString(); } }, grid: { color: grid } }\n      } },\n    plugins: [nocu]\n  });\n})();\n</script>", "line": "Crossing Kula Highway between Pukalani and Omaopio<div class=\"sub\">Most of the day, 42 updates. Furthest south about 17:07: Crossing Kula Highway between Omaopio and the middle Lower Kula Road junction</div>", "up": "<span class=\"num\">08:00</span> to about <span class=\"num\">16:30</span>", "wind": "<span class=\"num\">4 mph</span>, gusts to 14<div class=\"sub\">Lower elevations, during the upslope</div>"}